After completing this project, I learned:

1. Installing and configuring ArgoCD Core.
2. Creating an isolated Minikube profile.
3. Connecting ArgoCD with a GitHub repository.
4. Creating ArgoCD Applications and AppProjects.
5. Organizing Kubernetes manifests with Kustomize.
6. Implementing automated GitOps synchronization.
7. Understanding self-healing and pruning.
8. Deploying and verifying NGINX using Kubernetes.
9. Testing internal Kubernetes Service connectivity.

